"""Файлы: folders and files in rows or tiles; with --gallery, Галерея
(gallery.py): every photo, video and sound file on the tablet in one place.

The row of places under the header (Дом, Документы, Загрузки, Изображения,
Музыка, Видео, a memory card when one is in, Система) jumps there; "←"
goes up a folder; «Плитки»/«Список» switches how a folder shows, photos,
videos and sound covers as small pictures either way. A tap on a folder
opens it, a tap on a file opens it in the program for it: text in Блокнот
(haltia-text), photos here (the viewer goes through the folder's photos),
video in haltia-vplay, sound in the bar at the bottom (the folder's sound
files one after another), PDF and web pages in Firefox, anything else
with the system's default. A long press offers Редактировать (a text file, in
Блокнот), Копировать, Вырезать, Переименовать and Удалить (to the trash); «Вставить» puts what was copied or cut into
the folder shown. Hidden files stay hidden until «Скрытые» shows them.

With --portal it is the file chooser other programs get (portal.py,
chooser.py): an xdg-desktop-portal backend, started by D-Bus.
"""
import os
import shutil
import subprocess
import sys
import threading
import time

import gi
from gi.repository import GLib

